<title>USA: Primadonna CFO sees 15-20 pct growth.</title>
<headline>Primadonna CFO sees 15-20 pct growth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primadonna Resorts Inc Chief Financial Officer Craig Sullivan on Wednesday said he thought the company could achieve 15 to 20 percent annual growth in revenue and earnings from its properties on the Nevada-California border.</p>
<p>Sullivan said that growth target excluded the New York-New York Hotel, a Las Vegas casino that Primadonna owns with MGM Grand Inc.</p>
</text>
